      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead enrichment\nA web-form lead is **enriched from the company's own website** (fixture sites only; hidden text and text addressed to AI are removed first), **scored in code** against the ideal customer profile (configs/icp.yaml) and saved to the **CRM**. Hot leads ping #sales.\n\nThe AI gateway drafts a reply; **a person approves or edits it** in the dashboard before *Send reply* runs. Leads without a usable site, competitors and non-buyers go to research instead.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
